              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko umwami Dawidi yishura Orunani ati: “Oya, ndakwinginze unyemerere ndakurihe igiciro bikwiranye. Sinshobora gushikanira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ibintu vyawe, canke ngo nshikane ikimazi co guturirwa ata co ndakiguze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
