              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Dawidi ntiyashoboye kujayo ngo asiguze Imana, kuko yari yatekewe n’ubwoba igihe yabona ya nkota y’umumarayika w’",
          "type": "text",
